    ["s0083","idiomatic","Yuwang's army.","Yuyuewang's army.","於越王軍 preserves the Khitan honorific 於越 plus 王; Yuwang drops 越 and misreads the title, while Yuyuewang matches the source and the adjacent Weiwang / Yongkangwang naming pattern.","high","applied"],
